      "documentId": "a89b10a8-ecb2-4df9-b6ad-c88c2d0c0e4d",
      "value": "The history of the steam engine stretches back as far as the first century AD; the first recorded rudimentary steam engine being the aeolipile described by Greek mathematician Hero of Alexandria.",
